# reconciliation-investigator — .env.example
#
# Template for the gitignored repo-root .env. Parsed by the dependency-
# free loader in agents/model.py (_load_repo_dotenv; also reused by the
# Gemini judge scripts). Real environment variables always win over
# this file. Copy to .env and fill in; NEVER commit .env and never put
# a real key in this example file.
#
# POLICY (human ruling 2026-09-04): the Z.AI credential
# (ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY) is for Claude Code ONLY.
# Never place it in this repo's .env — the application must not read
# or use it (agents/model.py enforces GROQ_API_KEY instead).

# --- Core application (required) -------------------------------------
#
# Groq API key — the application's only model credential
# (agents/model.py: Groq openai/gpt-oss-120b, OpenAI-compatible).
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key-here

# --- Eval / judge harness (optional for the app; required to run the
#     Gemini-judge evals and canaries) ---------------------------------
#
# Gemini API key for the native Strands Gemini judge model
# (evals/gemini_judge_canary.py, gemini_judge_5case.py,
# groq_parsing_retry_canary.py — these exit if it is absent).
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# Judge request pacer, seconds between calls (rate-limit guard).
# Optional; default 4.3, clamped to [0.0, 3600.0]. Read at module
# import time — BEFORE the .env loader runs — so set it as a real
# environment variable (export GEMINI_MIN_INTERVAL_S=10); a line in
# .env would silently do nothing.

# --- Production-only (future non-EVAL_MODE path) ----------------------
#
# HMAC-SHA256 signing key for signed human-gate approval tokens.
# Required ONLY when EVAL_MODE != "1" (orchestrator/human_gate.py);
# EVAL_MODE=1 substitutes the committed non-secret dev key instead.
# Generate with e.g.: openssl rand -hex 32
#CORRECTION_TOKEN_SECRET=generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-32

# --- Documented so nobody "helpfully" adds them here ------------------
#
# EVAL_MODE: runtime switch read by tools/seed_data.py and
# orchestrator/human_gate.py. Set automatically by every eval entry
# point (evals/run_evals.py, evals/run_sequential.py,
# scripts/verify.sh) — do not put it in .env.
#
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY: probes/probe_*.py take credentials from an
# explicit --env-file argument and never read this repo's .env
# (Cerebras was also ruled a no-go on 2026-09-04). Listed only to
# preempt confusion.
#
# CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS is FORBIDDEN — the launcher
# refuses to start if it is set. CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR is provided
# automatically by the Claude Code harness. Neither belongs in .env.
